# What the sdist carries.
#
# **The test suite is shipped, so it has to be shippable.** The published 1.7.5 sdist held
# `test/test_*.py` and nothing else from that directory: no `spawn_guard.py`, so eight modules failed at
# import, and no `FORMAT_MATRIX.md`, so three more tests errored on a missing file. Measured by
# unpacking the published sdist and running its suite on Linux.
#
# `PERSONA.md` is here for the same reason a second time: `test_voice_wiring` compares a sentence in the
# document with the same sentence in the code, which is the check that keeps the two from drifting. An
# sdist without the document cannot run the test that guards it.
include LICENSE
include README.md
include FORMAT_MATRIX.md
include PERSONA.md
recursive-include test *.py
recursive-include tools *.py
recursive-include tools *.md
